flowchart LR
    Pharmacist[Pharmacist] --> Workbench[Medication Review Workbench]
    Workbench -->|HTTP + reviewer + version| API[FastAPI Review API]

    subgraph ReviewBoundary[Review service boundary]
        API --> Graph[Controlled LangGraph]
        API --> ReviewStore[(Review SQLite)]
        Graph --> Checkpoint[(Checkpoint SQLite)]
        Graph -. de-identified features .-> LLM[Configured LLM]
        LLM -. structured intent and coverage only .-> Graph
        NoWrite[No write tool in model scope]
        LLM -. blocked .-> NoWrite
    end

    Graph -->|read patient context| Health[Health Record MCP]
    Graph -->|read product and evidence| Drug[Drug Evidence MCP]
    Drug --> Neo4j[(Neo4j product graph)]
    Drug --> Milvus[(Milvus / LightRAG SPL)]
    Health --> HealthDB[(FHIR SQLite)]

    API == deterministic preview and commit ==> Health
    Health -->|add only| NewFHIR[DetectedIssue / Task / Provenance]
    Pharmacist -->|explicit confirm| API

    classDef human fill:#e8f3ef,stroke:#176b57,color:#102a25
    classDef service fill:#eef4fb,stroke:#2d5f8b,color:#172a3a
    classDef store fill:#f5f5f5,stroke:#666,color:#222
    classDef guard fill:#fff1e6,stroke:#a84f16,color:#5d2b0c
    class Pharmacist,Workbench human
    class API,Graph,Health,Drug,LLM service
    class ReviewStore,Checkpoint,Neo4j,Milvus,HealthDB store
    class NoWrite,NewFHIR guard
